### **Summary of Key Risks**
| **Risk Class**       | **Severity (0-1)** | **Primary Concern**                     |
|----------------------|-------------------|----------------------------------------|
| PerceptionRisk       | 0.7               | Wet road reflections, glare             |
| DynamicRisk          | 0.6               | Hydroplaning risk                      |
| OcclusionRisk        | 0.5               | Bridge structure blocking visibility   |
| CollisionRisk        | 0.4               | Following too closely                  |
| RegulatoryRisk       | 0.3               | Missed traffic signs                   |

